@page "/"
<PageTitle>Grot's Pizzeria</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <img src="img/hero.jpg" alt="Grot, wearing a monitoring dashboard visor, sliding a pepperoni pizza into a wood-fired oven" />
    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 data-testid="page-title">Welcome to Grot's Pizzeria</h1>
        <p>Hand-stretched dough, observable from oven to doorstep.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="grid grid-2">
    <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header"><h2>Hungry?</h2></div>
        <div class="panel-body">
            <p>Pick a pizza from the menu, add it to your cart and place your order. Then watch it go from the oven to your door.</p>
            <p>
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="menu">See the menu</a>
                <AuthorizeView>
                    <Authorized><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="orders">My orders</a></Authorized>
                    <NotAuthorized><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="login">Sign in</a></NotAuthorized>
                </AuthorizeView>
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header"><h2>Behind the counter</h2></div>
        <div class="panel-body">
            <p>Every order passes through five services written in five languages. Each one reports logs, metrics and traces with <span class="tag lang"><img src="img/lang/opentelemetry.svg" alt="" />OpenTelemetry</span>.</p>
            <ul class="service-list" aria-label="The services behind the counter">
                <li><span class="tag lang"><img src="img/lang/dotnet.svg" alt=".NET" /></span> web &amp; accounts (the BFF serving this page)</li>
                <li><span class="tag lang"><img src="img/lang/nodedotjs.svg" alt="" />Node.js</span> menu</li>
                <li><span class="tag lang"><img src="img/lang/openjdk.svg" alt="" />Java</span> orders</li>
                <li><span class="tag lang"><img src="img/lang/python.svg" alt="" />Python</span> checkout</li>
                <li><span class="tag lang"><img src="img/lang/go.svg" alt="Go" /></span> delivery tracking</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
